		{
			description: [
				"&lWelcome to the beginning of your Creator's Journey!&r"
				""
				"In a quiet corner of your world, where the mundane and extraordinary often brushed shoulders unnoticed, you felt a calling. It was subtle at first—a whisper carried by the wind, a peculiar shimmer in the night sky."
				""
				"To start your journey, click the checkmark under the word \"&9Tasks&r\" and then claim the &6Quest Reward&r. New challenges will begin to appear!"
				""
				"If new quests do not start appearing, try rejoining your world. Save the bread for your journey ahead, as you'll need sustenance to face the trials of the Creators."
			]
			icon: "farmersdelight:beef_patty"
			id: "6A52090D6BC064D7"
