			description: [
				"The icon in the top left of the screen is the &aFTB Teams &rmenu. This allows you to join forces with other travelers on this grand quest."
				""
				"To the right of the &aFTB Teams &ricon is the &6Quest Book &ricon, your guide to unraveling the secrets of the Creators."
				""
				"Each chapter will guide you through different realms of knowledge - from mastering the mechanical arts to harnessing magic, and eventually reaching for the stars themselves."
				""
				"The path ahead is filled with trials, but with ingenuity and determination, you may yet discover the Creators' ultimate legacy."
